WEBVTT

01:40.110 --> 01:43.009
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.170 --> 01:45.990
[Episode 7]

01:50.350 --> 01:51.750
I have a question for you.

01:52.600 --> 01:53.759
Not ashamed to ask,

01:54.100 --> 01:55.700
you've become a good boy now.

01:58.039 --> 01:58.970
Forget about it.

02:02.210 --> 02:03.290
What's your question?

02:03.290 --> 02:06.440
♫The trees and grass of the world sway with the wind♫

02:06.500 --> 02:09.620
♫Beneath the bodhi tree, dust gathers♫

02:11.840 --> 02:14.890
♫Who truly decides fate's design?♫

02:11.850 --> 02:13.170
I beg you to ask.

02:14.920 --> 02:18.040
♫Vividly painted in black and white♫

02:18.170 --> 02:19.500
Wen Xiao seems

02:19.540 --> 02:21.070
to be doing a lot better.

02:19.900 --> 02:23.010
♫It's water under the bridge♫

02:21.390 --> 02:22.270
Is it because...

02:22.270 --> 02:23.570
You know what? Let's just drop it.

02:23.050 --> 02:26.190
♫The moon sheds her light on my heart♫

02:24.300 --> 02:24.900
You...

02:25.190 --> 02:27.470
King Xiang wants us
back to report by noon.

02:27.470 --> 02:28.430
Why are you walking so slowly?

02:28.320 --> 02:31.370
♫The good old days are gone for good like that lantern in my dream♫

02:28.430 --> 02:29.760
Do you wanna get killed?

02:30.590 --> 02:31.620
-Your fault. -Your fault.

02:31.390 --> 02:34.940
♫See immortals enter Penglai♫

02:37.150 --> 02:37.890
Jiu!

02:39.260 --> 02:40.660
Brother Zhuo!

02:43.470 --> 02:45.030
I'm so glad to see you back.

02:45.070 --> 02:45.710
I was freaked out!

02:45.710 --> 02:47.350
I was waiting for you
in the Demon Hunting Bureau.

02:47.350 --> 02:48.990
They said if you don't come back
to report by noon,

02:48.990 --> 02:50.630
everyone will pay with their lives.

02:50.630 --> 02:52.310
I was afraid you'd leave me and run away,

02:52.310 --> 02:53.190
and I'd be the only one

02:53.190 --> 02:54.630
to suffer in the Demon Hunting Bureau.

02:54.630 --> 02:56.590
So I came out to welcome you

02:56.630 --> 02:57.620
but accidentally

02:57.620 --> 02:58.860
ended up in this mountain god temple.

02:58.860 --> 03:01.190
There's a demon inside!

03:08.190 --> 03:09.390
Let's go in and check.

03:10.990 --> 03:11.790
Let's go.

03:35.780 --> 03:36.870
Where's the demon?

04:08.250 --> 04:09.230
Jiu.

04:18.810 --> 04:20.190
No demons here.

04:20.430 --> 04:21.510
There is one!

04:22.550 --> 04:24.150
There's definitely one here!

04:24.150 --> 04:25.350
No demons.

04:26.310 --> 04:27.470
There is one.

04:29.310 --> 04:30.880
Such a big one here.

04:32.130 --> 04:33.390
It's not funny.

04:52.300 --> 04:53.590
They've gone for quite a while.

04:53.590 --> 04:55.450
Could they have run into trouble?

04:58.860 --> 05:00.400
If they still don't come back,

05:00.400 --> 05:02.150
you will be in big trouble.

05:22.310 --> 05:24.810
There's only a quarter of an hour left.

05:25.110 --> 05:26.510
The Demon Hunting Bureau

05:27.330 --> 05:29.660
shall either hand in the closing document

05:31.620 --> 05:32.950
or

05:33.150 --> 05:35.040
kill those five persons,

05:47.240 --> 05:48.990
This is my turf;

05:48.990 --> 05:50.630
I am the boss.

05:50.659 --> 05:52.600
If you want to pass...

05:52.950 --> 05:54.270
Little brat,

05:54.300 --> 05:55.630
ditching school

05:55.630 --> 05:56.830
to be a bandit here?

05:56.830 --> 05:57.720
Little?

05:57.460 --> 06:00.510
♫Leaving home, going far away from those mountains♫

05:58.110 --> 05:59.370
Who do you call little?

06:00.560 --> 06:02.940
♫And that stream♫

06:03.400 --> 06:08.670
♫The boy wiped away his tears and sang♫

06:09.470 --> 06:12.440
♫He carried his dreams with him♫

06:12.470 --> 06:14.490
♫Jingling all the way♫

06:14.630 --> 06:16.750
♫Wind, rain, and light♫

06:16.820 --> 06:20.010
♫Wandering with me♫

06:45.659 --> 06:46.510
Little girl,

06:46.630 --> 06:48.230
the temple is a solemn place.

06:48.330 --> 06:49.450
Please be quiet.

06:50.310 --> 06:51.840
Who are you calling "girl"?

06:53.350 --> 06:54.310
Not a girl?

06:54.340 --> 06:55.480
He's so short.

06:58.159 --> 06:59.820
He just hit a nerve directly.

06:59.840 --> 07:00.930
Why are you laughing?

07:00.930 --> 07:01.690
I...

07:02.070 --> 07:03.380
You really broke his heart,

07:03.380 --> 07:04.400
boy.

07:04.470 --> 07:05.640
Boy?

07:06.590 --> 07:07.840
If I tell you my age,

07:07.860 --> 07:09.460
you'll certainly freak out.

07:14.550 --> 07:15.550
This man

07:15.550 --> 07:16.920
is 34,000 years old.

07:19.670 --> 07:21.000
It's this demon.

07:21.780 --> 07:23.380
A thousand-year-old demon.

07:23.910 --> 07:25.440
Who are you calling a demon?

07:25.440 --> 07:28.040
Other than demons,
immortals are also as old as the hills.

07:28.040 --> 07:28.940
Got it?

07:48.150 --> 07:49.950
You're in a mountain god temple.

07:49.950 --> 07:50.560
I

07:50.750 --> 07:52.409
am the Mountain God, Yinglei!

07:53.150 --> 07:55.240
If you dare to offend me in my place,

07:55.550 --> 07:56.280
you'll end up

07:56.560 --> 07:59.220
just like those people
crying out on the ground.

08:00.270 --> 08:01.310
Who is he?

08:01.490 --> 08:03.090
He sounds so full of himself.

08:03.230 --> 08:04.200
Half a demon.

08:05.190 --> 08:06.670
He is half-god and half-demon,

08:06.670 --> 08:08.730
a scion of the Mountain God Yingzhao.

08:09.360 --> 08:11.030
Did your grandpa let you

08:11.160 --> 08:12.540
leave home so easily?

08:13.980 --> 08:16.320
The Mountain God of the Wilderness
is already stuck in a mess

08:16.320 --> 08:17.840
and has no time for me.

08:18.310 --> 08:19.240
The Wilderness?

08:20.380 --> 08:22.240
What happened in the Wilderness?

08:26.210 --> 08:27.840
After the Baize Token disappeared,

08:27.840 --> 08:29.770
the Wilderness began to collapse.

08:30.110 --> 08:31.430
Grandfather and the others had to close

08:31.430 --> 08:32.620
the Kunlun Gate

08:33.039 --> 08:35.809
and cut off the connection
between the Wilderness and the mortal realm.

08:35.809 --> 08:37.940
That's how the collapse was relieved.

08:38.030 --> 08:39.070
But after that,

08:39.169 --> 08:40.870
another monster appeared,

08:41.059 --> 08:43.570
opening the Kunlun Gate by force
without authorization.

08:43.570 --> 08:45.870
Then loads of demons flocked
into the mortal world,

08:45.870 --> 08:47.050
causing chaos in both realms.

08:47.050 --> 08:48.170
That's the root

08:48.270 --> 08:50.630
of the further decreased and unsustainable

08:50.630 --> 08:52.230
spiritual energy in Kunlun.

08:53.090 --> 08:54.770
Grandpa and other Mountain Gods

08:54.770 --> 08:56.640
had no choice but to use their divine power

08:56.640 --> 08:58.370
to barely maintain stability.

08:59.670 --> 09:02.200
But we don't know how long
they have to hold on.

09:05.280 --> 09:05.910
Ugh,

09:06.270 --> 09:07.270
so annoying.

09:07.790 --> 09:09.440
It’s all that Baize Goddess's fault.

09:09.440 --> 09:10.580
The Wilderness is about to collapse,

09:10.580 --> 09:11.740
yet where is she?

09:28.860 --> 09:30.710
You are really unfilial.

09:30.730 --> 09:32.310
Your grandpa's fighting so hard in the Wilderness,

09:32.310 --> 09:34.420
while you're making a fuss
in the mortal world, huh?

09:34.420 --> 09:36.220
I'm not here for fun.

09:36.280 --> 09:37.590
I'm here to realize my dream.

09:37.590 --> 09:39.650
And my grandpa actually supports me.

09:42.040 --> 09:43.100
Maybe he allowed me

09:43.720 --> 09:45.850
to do it because he knew the Wilderness

09:45.890 --> 09:47.040
would be doomed.

09:52.500 --> 09:53.640
You come across

09:53.700 --> 09:55.410
as even worse this way.

09:57.210 --> 09:58.180
Who are you,

09:58.230 --> 09:59.050
yapping here nonstop?

09:59.050 --> 10:00.790
He is a great demon, for real.

10:00.870 --> 10:01.760
Are you scared?

10:01.950 --> 10:04.080
He feeds on those with beards like you.

10:04.300 --> 10:05.640
I don't care if he's a great demon or not!

10:05.640 --> 10:07.260
I'm the boss of this place!

10:07.300 --> 10:08.830
-You know what... -Enough.

10:09.020 --> 10:10.030
Why should we stop

10:10.030 --> 10:11.830
to listen to two kids bickering?

10:12.110 --> 10:13.190
Alright, stop it.

10:13.920 --> 10:16.450
Show some respect
to those people over there.

10:16.470 --> 10:18.630
They are here to kill us seriously.

10:20.210 --> 10:20.600
Go!

10:21.070 --> 10:21.530
Shoo,

10:21.760 --> 10:22.230
shoo!

10:22.910 --> 10:23.830
Hurry up...

10:23.830 --> 10:24.390
Go!

10:24.600 --> 10:26.320
Get up, or I'll kick you hard!

10:27.870 --> 10:29.080
It's getting late.

10:29.650 --> 10:31.200
Let's hurry up and hit the road.

10:31.200 --> 10:34.000
What should we do
with this little demon in our way?

10:34.670 --> 10:36.170
Do we have to deal with him?

10:36.550 --> 10:38.550
If so, when it's done, the sun will set,

10:38.550 --> 10:40.190
and I'll be dead.

10:40.670 --> 10:42.770
This is the demon expert
in the Demon Hunting Bureau,

10:42.770 --> 10:44.950
who specializes in catching little demons like you.

10:44.950 --> 10:45.810
Mm,

10:46.310 --> 10:48.690
delicate-skinned demons are good.

10:49.070 --> 10:50.380
And half-god,

10:50.510 --> 10:52.070
half-demon types like you

10:52.270 --> 10:53.280
are even better.

10:54.710 --> 10:56.110
You think you can beat me?

10:57.330 --> 10:58.320
Kneel.

11:07.310 --> 11:08.120
Move.

11:13.870 --> 11:14.510
Stop.

11:14.530 --> 11:15.340
Stop.

11:15.710 --> 11:16.190
Okay.

11:16.260 --> 11:16.830
I give in.

11:18.890 --> 11:19.810
What is it?

11:20.070 --> 11:20.800
So powerful.

11:21.030 --> 11:22.270
It numbed my whole body

11:22.270 --> 11:23.330
and knocked me out.

11:23.590 --> 11:26.480
I know your mountain god temples
keep myriad artifacts.

11:26.480 --> 11:30.150
If you don't wanna be taken back
to the Demon Hunting Bureau to suffer,

11:30.150 --> 11:32.190
just hand over

11:32.670 --> 11:33.900
your treasures.

11:45.810 --> 11:46.780
Fine...

11:49.090 --> 11:50.220
My precious pepper.

12:09.370 --> 12:10.890
What treasures are these?

12:11.000 --> 12:12.730
Are you trying to fool us?

12:12.990 --> 12:14.190
They are my treasures!

12:14.190 --> 12:15.620
Treasures that lead me to my dream.

12:15.620 --> 12:17.490
It took me a lot of effort to collect them.

12:17.490 --> 12:18.750
You don't understand.

12:24.550 --> 12:27.120
I'm carrying my dream every day.

12:29.470 --> 12:30.590
Your dream

12:31.070 --> 12:32.290
is to carry the wok?

12:32.950 --> 12:33.880
It's to be a chef!

12:34.720 --> 12:37.580
A top chef who makes delicacies
in the mortal world!

12:40.780 --> 12:41.910
Everything's here.

12:46.270 --> 12:47.230
Not these.

12:59.300 --> 13:00.500
You mean this, right?

13:08.570 --> 13:09.720
What is it?

13:10.390 --> 13:11.830
An incense burner, I guess?

13:11.830 --> 13:12.700
This is the artifact

13:12.700 --> 13:14.600
that the Mountain Gods use

13:14.670 --> 13:16.310
to teleport across hills and peaks,

13:16.310 --> 13:17.840
called the Shanhai Portal.

13:17.870 --> 13:18.830
With it,

13:18.830 --> 13:21.890
we can rush back
to the Demon Hunting Bureau right away.

13:22.270 --> 13:23.480
How to use it?

13:24.010 --> 13:26.070
This is the Mountain God's artifact.

13:26.170 --> 13:27.200
So of course,

13:27.510 --> 13:29.770
it needs the Mountain God to cast a spell.

13:30.910 --> 13:33.010
You just called me a little demon.

13:33.150 --> 13:34.950
Now you call me the Mountain God.

13:36.190 --> 13:37.080
So worldly.

13:37.710 --> 13:38.960
And this is mine.

13:38.960 --> 13:40.420
Why should I let you use it?

13:41.300 --> 13:42.470
If you help us,

13:42.470 --> 13:44.180
we will do you a favor too.

13:44.810 --> 13:45.790
What favor?

13:46.790 --> 13:47.750
I have neither desires

13:47.750 --> 13:49.030
nor anxiety.

13:51.460 --> 13:53.190
To help you realize your dream.

13:55.870 --> 13:57.360
Don't you want to be a chef?

13:57.620 --> 13:59.020
Our Demon Hunting Bureau

13:59.040 --> 14:00.300
happens to need a chef.

14:01.160 --> 14:02.150
You...

14:05.210 --> 14:06.610
Don't you mind that I'm a demon?

14:06.610 --> 14:09.270
You just called yourself a little Mountain God.

14:09.510 --> 14:11.090
Of course, we don't mind it.

14:11.120 --> 14:14.120
The Demon Hunting Bureau deals with demons every day.

14:18.580 --> 14:19.830
And we have a large personnel,

14:19.830 --> 14:21.270
requiring various delicacies every day.

14:21.270 --> 14:22.420
We've also got servants

14:22.420 --> 14:25.130
specifically responsible for buying
all sorts of fresh daily ingredients.

14:25.130 --> 14:26.190
The whole kitchen

14:26.190 --> 14:28.310
is as large as your mountain god temple,

14:28.310 --> 14:30.910
providing a complete set of kitchenware.

14:41.310 --> 14:42.070
She's right.

14:46.150 --> 14:46.950
OK!

14:54.150 --> 14:55.410
The Shanhai Portal

14:55.590 --> 14:58.120
can only help you teleport to a place you know.

14:58.310 --> 14:59.870
Have you been to the Demon Hunting Bureau?

14:59.870 --> 15:00.700
Sure.

15:00.920 --> 15:03.120
I've sneaked over there several times.

15:10.050 --> 15:11.010
Let's begin.

15:18.810 --> 15:19.530
Go!

15:20.370 --> 15:23.090
♫First time being in this world♫

15:23.160 --> 15:28.610
♫Let me enjoy all the splendors♫

15:41.520 --> 15:44.440
♫Leaving home, going far away from those mountains♫

15:44.500 --> 15:46.770
♫And that stream♫

15:47.270 --> 15:52.410
♫The boy wiped away his tears and sang♫

15:53.520 --> 15:56.370
♫He carried his dreams with him♫

15:56.420 --> 15:58.490
♫Jingling all the way♫

15:58.680 --> 16:00.760
♫Wind, rain, and light♫

16:00.830 --> 16:03.980
♫Wandering with me♫

16:07.030 --> 16:08.730
Looks like the Demon Hunting Bureau

16:08.730 --> 16:10.200
can't solve the case.

16:12.240 --> 16:13.510
In that case,

16:15.020 --> 16:17.580
I'll send you to hell first.

16:40.430 --> 16:41.510
Mr. Zhen Mei.

17:10.950 --> 17:12.349
Mr. Fan Ying,

17:13.550 --> 17:15.210
the Water Ghost case has been solved.

17:15.210 --> 17:16.730
Our advance team of five

17:16.750 --> 17:17.859
is back to report.

17:27.859 --> 17:29.200
Let's wait and see.

17:55.320 --> 17:56.460
Who is this?

17:56.530 --> 17:57.790
Nice to meet you, sirs.

17:57.990 --> 17:58.950
I'm Yinglei,

17:58.970 --> 18:00.800
a newbie in the Demon Hunting Bureau as a...

18:00.800 --> 18:01.710
A chef!

18:24.070 --> 18:26.560
The Water Ghost case is over.

18:26.870 --> 18:28.380
The Great Demon invited us

18:28.460 --> 18:29.910
to his home in the suburbs of Tiandu

18:29.910 --> 18:31.510
for a drink and celebration.

18:31.800 --> 18:32.730
Sister Pei,

18:34.330 --> 18:35.590
are you coming with me?

18:44.660 --> 18:46.500
Even if you're leaving,

18:47.110 --> 18:49.440
you should at least bid a proper farewell.

18:56.150 --> 18:58.880
I've decided to stay
in the Demon Hunting Bureau.

19:02.710 --> 19:03.600
What's wrong?

19:04.750 --> 19:06.040
You don't want me to?

19:06.510 --> 19:07.960
I'd love to hear that!

19:07.280 --> 19:09.500
♫An arrow in the hand♫

19:10.110 --> 19:12.400
♫A string in the heart♫

19:13.030 --> 19:18.370
♫A backside standing, turning into forever♫

19:18.650 --> 19:20.940
♫The moon shines on the south♫

19:21.530 --> 19:23.790
♫But I look north♫

19:24.310 --> 19:29.390
♫I only hope the snow comes a bit later♫

19:27.680 --> 19:28.880
I didn't want to

19:29.710 --> 19:31.750
get involved in demon stuff anymore.

19:29.890 --> 19:32.220
♫Intimately bound together in the cold world♫

19:32.290 --> 19:35.030
♫Even death can't break our ties♫

19:34.510 --> 19:36.640
Or maybe I was just avoiding it.

19:35.140 --> 19:38.320
♫Like intertwined fates, debt, love, and hatred♫

19:37.560 --> 19:39.020
But in life

19:38.360 --> 19:40.920
♫Reluctant but with no resentment♫

19:39.800 --> 19:40.800
I see with my eyes,

19:41.140 --> 19:46.420
♫Only half of the bows and arrows remain♫

19:41.790 --> 19:42.920
listen with my ears,

19:43.840 --> 19:45.300
and observe with my heart,

19:46.590 --> 19:49.190
just to see through everything

19:46.840 --> 19:51.870
♫Night and dawn are forever kept apart♫

19:49.950 --> 19:51.550
and live a sober life.

19:51.960 --> 19:54.650
♫If you were a spring night♫

19:54.710 --> 19:57.340
♫I'm the silent mountain♫

19:54.950 --> 19:57.150
So I've decided not to run away anymore.

19:57.680 --> 20:00.400
♫You're a sad firefly♫

20:00.480 --> 20:03.180
♫Guarding the last moment of night♫

20:03.340 --> 20:06.040
♫Why don't you remember♫

20:04.960 --> 20:06.380
The word "dawn"

20:06.110 --> 20:08.790
♫I'm always by your side♫

20:08.230 --> 20:09.550
has dawned on me.

20:08.820 --> 20:10.650
♫Like wind surrounding flowers♫

20:10.730 --> 20:13.320
♫Guarding the memories♫

20:13.530 --> 20:17.560
♫Never fading away♫

20:13.750 --> 20:14.790
The day breaks.

20:16.790 --> 20:17.820
Thank you

20:19.480 --> 20:20.880
for turning my dark night

20:22.820 --> 20:25.260
♫Turns out I'm a wanderer♫

20:24.040 --> 20:25.700
into a dawn.

20:25.310 --> 20:28.110
♫And you're a song of reluctant parting♫

20:28.130 --> 20:31.280
♫In the sky of floating snowflakes♫

20:31.340 --> 20:33.850
♫You are the only warm bloom♫

20:33.920 --> 20:36.370
♫But why don't I remember♫

20:36.410 --> 20:39.130
♫How much the plot has twisted?♫

20:39.490 --> 20:41.250
♫I forgot the bitter karma♫

20:41.310 --> 20:43.910
♫I missed it again and again♫

20:43.950 --> 20:47.610
♫Helpess♫

20:47.730 --> 20:50.280
♫Turns out I'm a wanderer♫

20:50.370 --> 20:53.160
♫And you're a song of reluctant parting♫

20:53.180 --> 20:56.340
♫I'm a black and white wound♫

20:56.400 --> 20:58.990
♫You're the vibrant red color♫

20:59.080 --> 21:01.830
♫How can I not remember♫

21:01.920 --> 21:04.560
♫You're always by my side♫

21:04.590 --> 21:06.400
♫Like wind surrounding flowers♫

21:06.450 --> 21:14.680
♫Guarding the memories, never fading away♫

21:33.550 --> 21:35.010
Falling flowers,

21:35.440 --> 21:36.900
permeating fragrance.

21:38.070 --> 21:38.750
How is it?

21:39.270 --> 21:40.720
Isn't my place pretty nice?

21:40.720 --> 21:42.070
A seclusion in the bustling city,

21:42.070 --> 21:43.590
adorned with natural beauty.

21:43.590 --> 21:44.770
It is quite good.

21:45.000 --> 21:46.390
But it doesn't feel like

21:46.390 --> 21:48.120
the kind of place you'd live in.

21:48.360 --> 21:49.310
Oh?

21:50.520 --> 21:52.250
I specially opened the barrier

21:52.280 --> 21:54.220
to welcome all of you.

21:54.250 --> 21:56.160
Why are you so mean to me?

21:57.410 --> 21:59.210
Then tell me, Mr. Zhuo,

21:59.320 --> 22:00.800
where should I live?

22:01.250 --> 22:02.580
The place you live

22:02.610 --> 22:04.920
should have corpses, bones, and blood

22:05.090 --> 22:06.520
all over.

22:08.190 --> 22:09.550
That suits your image.

22:12.580 --> 22:14.780
Only those soaked in blood

22:14.950 --> 22:16.670
love bathing, burning incense,

22:16.670 --> 22:18.200
and having flowers around.

22:18.430 --> 22:20.060
After all these years in the mortal world,

22:20.060 --> 22:21.350
my biggest gain

22:21.380 --> 22:23.070
is to learn that

22:24.270 --> 22:24.830
a human

22:25.390 --> 22:28.090
should know how to hide his true self.

22:30.790 --> 22:31.790
You're not human.

22:35.100 --> 22:36.780
So sharp all of a sudden.

22:36.800 --> 22:38.540
I didn't expect that.

22:44.340 --> 22:45.970
Zhuo Yichen, Zhuo Yichen.

22:45.990 --> 22:47.740
Zhao Yuanzhou, Zhao Yuanzhou.

22:57.990 --> 22:59.710
Let's celebrate our teamwork

22:59.740 --> 23:01.540
in solving the Water Ghost case.

23:01.630 --> 23:03.020
The crisis of the Demon Hunting Bureau

23:03.020 --> 23:04.480
has finally been settled.

23:04.540 --> 23:06.030
The Demon Hunting Bureau survived,

23:06.030 --> 23:07.070
and so did I!

23:07.100 --> 23:07.940
Great!

23:08.050 --> 23:09.490
Don't get carried away.

23:09.550 --> 23:10.470
In the Demon Hunting Bureau,

23:10.470 --> 23:12.630
you may lose your life at any time.

23:13.750 --> 23:15.930
It's still not too late

23:15.950 --> 23:16.710
to quit now.

23:18.650 --> 23:20.250
I was a little scared before.

23:20.680 --> 23:21.580
But our team

23:21.670 --> 23:23.880
has Mr. Zhuo, the strongest one in Tiandu.

23:23.880 --> 23:25.210
I'm not afraid anymore.

23:27.310 --> 23:28.950
When we were in danger,

23:29.190 --> 23:30.070
Mr. Zhuo

23:30.070 --> 23:31.870
was always protecting me.

23:33.710 --> 23:35.240
I can also protect you, too!

23:35.400 --> 23:36.880
I’m the Mountain God!

23:42.270 --> 23:44.460
Wen, hope you find
and get the Baize Token back soon.

23:44.460 --> 23:45.900
Then, those demons and monsters

23:45.900 --> 23:47.770
can't cause chaos in the mortal world

23:47.770 --> 23:49.170
and hurt humans anymore.

23:49.550 --> 23:51.360
No more tragedies like what happened

23:51.360 --> 23:53.100
to Ran Yi and Miss Qi.

23:54.360 --> 23:54.930
Mm.

23:54.960 --> 23:56.160
With the Baize Token,

23:56.160 --> 23:58.420
even the greatest demons are no big deal.

23:59.580 --> 24:00.420
Brilliant.

24:00.440 --> 24:03.040
I swear I'll help you
find and retrieve it, Wen.

24:04.490 --> 24:05.700
Then my mom will...

24:08.710 --> 24:09.640
What did you say?

24:10.760 --> 24:11.560
Bai Jiu?

24:14.030 --> 24:15.130
Nothing.

24:16.840 --> 24:17.620
Cheers.

24:18.430 --> 24:19.270
Cheers!

24:27.670 --> 24:29.300
Why is it tea for me?

24:30.050 --> 24:31.730
No alcohol for kids.

24:33.640 --> 24:35.870
You call me a kid.

24:36.030 --> 24:37.190
Then how old are you?

24:39.440 --> 24:42.020
I should be 18

24:42.540 --> 24:44.030
in human years.

24:44.830 --> 24:45.550
Eight...

24:46.110 --> 24:46.740
Eighteen?

24:47.360 --> 24:49.680
Eighteen with this thick beard?

24:52.060 --> 24:53.960
Guess it's time for a shave.

24:55.030 --> 24:57.810
I'll sneak into Zhao Yuanzhou's room later.

24:57.830 --> 24:59.490
He has no beard

24:59.550 --> 25:00.570
at his age.

25:00.790 --> 25:01.920
He must have a razor.

25:07.480 --> 25:09.070
I'm gonna be ugly.

25:10.630 --> 25:12.000
Mirror, mirror,

25:12.150 --> 25:12.950
promise me.

25:13.680 --> 25:14.960
Please remember

25:15.150 --> 25:17.470
how handsome I look at over 200.

25:28.420 --> 25:29.220
Well...

25:30.030 --> 25:31.470
How can I refill my tea?

25:31.490 --> 25:32.750
I also want it.

25:32.780 --> 25:33.420
Come on.

25:33.950 --> 25:34.750
A little.

25:34.750 --> 25:35.610
That's enough.

26:02.030 --> 26:02.630
Wow.

26:03.070 --> 26:04.160
What is this?

26:10.900 --> 26:12.390
A kid's meal I made

26:12.390 --> 26:13.760
just for you!

26:13.790 --> 26:14.580
Let me try.

26:16.660 --> 26:17.790
How is it?

26:17.810 --> 26:19.160
How's my cooking?

26:19.190 --> 26:20.790
It tastes so good!

26:23.670 --> 26:24.650
By the way, Yinglei,

26:24.650 --> 26:26.930
I helped you realize your dream and become a chef

26:26.930 --> 26:28.610
in the Demon Hunting Bureau.

26:28.910 --> 26:30.070
So,

26:30.070 --> 26:31.670
shouldn't you repay me?

26:32.750 --> 26:33.870
No problem!

26:35.380 --> 26:37.590
Help me steal Zhao Yuanzhou's bottle.

26:41.130 --> 26:42.320
Well...

26:42.470 --> 26:43.270
That's...

26:44.420 --> 26:45.750
actually a big problem.

26:47.430 --> 26:49.500
I'm just curious

26:49.520 --> 26:52.030
what on earth is in his bottle.

26:52.130 --> 26:53.780
This Great Demon hasn't

26:53.800 --> 26:55.690
had anything the whole trip
but what's in his bottle.

26:55.690 --> 26:56.560
I got you!

26:59.180 --> 27:01.340
I've already sniffed out

27:01.360 --> 27:03.010
what's in his bottle.

27:03.660 --> 27:05.980
Jade bracelets!

27:07.890 --> 27:08.840
Sir,

27:08.950 --> 27:10.550
what kind of jade do you like?

27:10.810 --> 27:11.910
I have no preference.

27:11.910 --> 27:12.990
As long as it's jade.

27:12.990 --> 27:13.610
OK...

27:17.270 --> 27:18.110
Do you guys know

27:18.110 --> 27:19.530
jade cream?

27:19.710 --> 27:20.390
Jade cream?

27:29.870 --> 27:31.130
According to the book,

27:31.150 --> 27:33.220
the Mountain of Jade produces jade cream,

27:33.220 --> 27:35.120
which, mixed with the powdered Heartless Herb,

27:35.120 --> 27:36.640
can turn into liquid.

27:37.270 --> 27:38.200
Drink it,

27:38.470 --> 27:40.070
and you can become immortal.

27:40.380 --> 27:41.440
Not that powerful.

27:41.440 --> 27:42.640
That's to tease kids.

27:43.830 --> 27:44.800
But having plenty of it

27:44.800 --> 27:45.920
can prolong your life

27:45.920 --> 27:48.050
and replenish your spiritual energy.

27:50.000 --> 27:50.950
No wonder that Great Demon

27:50.950 --> 27:53.330
holds his bottle every day
without letting go.

27:53.330 --> 27:55.130
So it's really his food reserve.

27:57.990 --> 27:59.140
The Great Demon

27:59.160 --> 28:01.250
was just chatting with Mr. Zhuo.

28:01.430 --> 28:02.830
But where is he now?

28:08.080 --> 28:09.740
How about we make another bet?

28:11.790 --> 28:12.790
Bet on what?

28:13.280 --> 28:16.630
Let's see who's the first to solve
the water ghost bride abduction case.

28:16.630 --> 28:17.700
The loser

28:18.240 --> 28:20.390
should do one thing for the other.

28:20.420 --> 28:21.220
Deal.

28:22.840 --> 28:24.080
But that thing

28:24.690 --> 28:27.090
should be within the loser's capabilities

28:27.560 --> 28:29.110
and can't be immoral.

28:30.690 --> 28:31.710
Keep your promise,

28:31.710 --> 28:32.710
Mr. Zhuo.

28:33.630 --> 28:35.060
You're pulling a long face.

28:35.060 --> 28:37.920
Don't tell me you have zero tolerance
even for this.

28:38.480 --> 28:40.340
Do you have eyes behind your back?

28:41.150 --> 28:42.640
I'm looking great.

28:45.260 --> 28:46.590
Wen Xiao and I were the first

28:46.590 --> 28:48.800
to solve the water ghost bride abduction case.

28:48.800 --> 28:51.170
You have such a poor memory, Mr. Zhuo.

28:51.510 --> 28:53.150
You said it yourself

28:53.270 --> 28:55.470
that I knew the murderer was Ran Yi

28:55.910 --> 28:58.240
before I came to the Demon Hunting Bureau.

28:58.500 --> 29:00.560
So I solved the case first, of course.

29:02.530 --> 29:03.790
I admit defeat.

29:04.280 --> 29:05.990
But you won unjustly.

29:06.780 --> 29:08.630
You knew Ran committed a crime,

29:08.810 --> 29:10.610
yet you still colluded with him.

29:11.470 --> 29:12.790
You are accomplices.

29:15.240 --> 29:16.900
Something's heavy on my head.

29:17.390 --> 29:18.640
My neck hurts.

29:20.810 --> 29:22.410
What's wrong with you again?

29:22.840 --> 29:25.330
Someone put the "heavy" blame on me.

29:26.310 --> 29:26.910
You...

29:35.760 --> 29:36.860
I did this

29:37.670 --> 29:39.670
because I know you too well.

29:41.020 --> 29:42.510
Ridiculous.

29:43.140 --> 29:45.190
We've only known each other for a few days.

29:45.190 --> 29:46.380
You know me?

29:48.520 --> 29:49.470
Dream on.

29:50.200 --> 29:52.220
Everyone in Tiandu knows

29:53.230 --> 29:54.350
Mr. Zhuo

29:54.350 --> 29:55.830
is handsome

29:55.830 --> 29:57.210
and charming.

29:57.230 --> 30:00.360
You're like a sharp sword
when dealing with evil demons,

30:00.390 --> 30:02.990
upholding justice,

30:03.150 --> 30:04.750
sticking to principles,

30:04.750 --> 30:06.390
and having ambition.

30:07.350 --> 30:08.710
Right?

30:10.950 --> 30:11.750
Indeed.

30:14.390 --> 30:15.390
So,

30:16.270 --> 30:17.630
if I had told you

30:17.630 --> 30:19.630
the murderer Ran Yi's whereabouts,

30:19.730 --> 30:22.070
the righteous Mr. Zhuo

30:22.420 --> 30:25.080
would have left in no time
to arrest Ran for sure.

30:25.600 --> 30:28.400
Then how could we find clues
about the Baize Token?

30:29.320 --> 30:31.950
The less flexible it is,
the easier it is to break.

30:31.950 --> 30:34.720
You can't stick to the rules too rigidly.

30:34.980 --> 30:36.450
To achieve a goal,

30:36.480 --> 30:39.290
sometimes we have to use special methods.

30:39.630 --> 30:40.740
Mr. Zhuo,

30:41.600 --> 30:42.920
am I right?

30:43.950 --> 30:45.200
Flexibility is okay,

30:45.480 --> 30:47.410
but not always tricks and schemes.

30:53.780 --> 30:55.110
Could you push it for me?

30:56.080 --> 30:56.750
Move.

30:58.280 --> 30:58.960
You...

31:05.990 --> 31:07.890
You hid Ran Yi's whereabouts

31:07.920 --> 31:10.120
and even tried to drag us into your plan.

31:11.010 --> 31:12.540
It's obviously deception.

31:12.790 --> 31:14.980
Unfortunately, you are too smart.

31:15.590 --> 31:16.480
My plan failed.

31:16.720 --> 31:19.470
It doesn't mean you didn't do it.

31:20.140 --> 31:21.130
Zhao Yuanzhou,

31:21.700 --> 31:23.230
your eloquence

31:23.250 --> 31:24.580
can deceive Zhuo,

31:24.610 --> 31:25.920
but not me.

31:27.530 --> 31:28.860
She means you're goofy.

31:30.410 --> 31:30.990
I...

31:33.740 --> 31:35.030
Despite

31:35.140 --> 31:36.640
our different personalities

31:36.640 --> 31:38.040
and ways of doing things,

31:38.330 --> 31:40.070
we have the same goal.

31:40.400 --> 31:42.470
So we should be honest with each other

31:42.470 --> 31:43.110
and discuss more.

31:43.110 --> 31:43.910
Trust

31:44.770 --> 31:46.500
is like a swing.

31:46.890 --> 31:48.890
You must trust the people behind you

31:49.130 --> 31:50.620
to swing higher.

31:51.880 --> 31:53.740
You are so good at pushing a swing.

31:54.090 --> 31:55.930
Don't you understand that?

32:04.110 --> 32:05.370
The little demon Ran Yi

32:06.660 --> 32:07.980
is not dangerous.

32:09.020 --> 32:10.020
What about Li Lun?

32:10.740 --> 32:12.590
You hid the existence of Li Lun,

32:12.590 --> 32:13.750
and he almost got Wen Xiao...

32:13.750 --> 32:15.550
Li Lun wouldn't really kill her.

32:17.060 --> 32:19.390
If Li Lun tried to kill Wen Xiao seriously,

32:20.510 --> 32:21.770
you couldn’t stop him.

32:25.360 --> 32:26.750
What is he up to?

32:31.590 --> 32:32.510
I don't know.

32:34.330 --> 32:35.510
It's always hard

32:36.690 --> 32:38.390
to read his mind.

32:42.740 --> 32:43.610
Move.

32:48.560 --> 32:50.300
Mr. Zhuo, you quit?

32:51.310 --> 32:53.950
Are you angry because I said

32:54.070 --> 32:55.700
you're too rigid?

32:56.590 --> 32:58.070
Didn't you just say

32:58.120 --> 32:59.420
you only like sitting on the swing,

32:59.420 --> 33:01.070
not pushing it?

33:01.310 --> 33:03.620
Aren't you enjoying pushing it now?

33:04.520 --> 33:07.010
Old liar.

33:07.750 --> 33:09.260
So that's why you're mad.

33:09.670 --> 33:10.700
Come here, then.

33:10.730 --> 33:11.930
Let me push it for you.

33:16.190 --> 33:17.230
Ridiculous.

33:18.050 --> 33:19.190
Adults

33:19.310 --> 33:21.110
are not obsessed with the swing!

33:25.320 --> 33:27.050
He's mocking you.

33:27.980 --> 33:29.090
Keep pushing.

33:30.870 --> 33:31.680
Move.

33:31.800 --> 33:34.200
They must be having fun with the swing, huh?

33:34.530 --> 33:35.590
Mr. Zhuo

33:35.590 --> 33:36.670
on the swing?

33:49.100 --> 33:51.100
Bai Jiu just said you...

33:51.490 --> 33:52.690
Is the wine good?

33:58.310 --> 33:59.330
Not bad!

33:59.360 --> 34:00.950
The pomegranate wine
from Tianxiang Pavilion

34:00.950 --> 34:02.950
is indeed worthy of its reputation.

34:03.130 --> 34:05.550
The smell is mellow and fragrant.

34:06.770 --> 34:08.150
Little Mountain God,

34:08.190 --> 34:10.850
you just came down the mountain
and already got so much info.

34:10.850 --> 34:12.460
You even know Tianxiang Pavilion?

34:12.460 --> 34:13.449
Yeah.

34:16.280 --> 34:17.670
When I just left the mountain,

34:17.670 --> 34:18.449
I heard that

34:18.480 --> 34:19.429
Tianxiang Pavilion

34:19.429 --> 34:21.090
was holding a beauty contest.

34:21.300 --> 34:22.800
There must be good wine

34:22.830 --> 34:24.159
as well as lovely girls.

34:25.810 --> 34:27.670
I'm thinking about finding a chance

34:27.670 --> 34:28.989
to have fun there one day.

34:28.989 --> 34:31.370
If you go, I'll tell Sister Wen.

34:36.440 --> 34:38.210
Unless you take me with you,

34:38.230 --> 34:39.420
and I won't tell her.

34:39.440 --> 34:40.360
You...

34:40.820 --> 34:41.870
You...

34:44.170 --> 34:45.130
Drink some more.

34:45.159 --> 34:45.870
C'mon...

34:45.870 --> 34:46.550
No, thanks.

34:47.190 --> 34:48.310
It's wet...

34:49.560 --> 34:50.900
It's okay. I'll hang it up to dry.

34:50.900 --> 34:52.110
Just a small patch is wet.

34:52.110 --> 34:53.440
Why bother?

35:02.670 --> 35:03.590
Sister Pei.

35:05.900 --> 35:07.300
You don't

35:07.330 --> 35:08.610
look so well.

35:10.820 --> 35:11.680
[File]

35:15.190 --> 35:17.390
There's another murder case in Tiandu.

35:52.950 --> 35:56.620
[File]

35:56.760 --> 35:59.560
[File]

36:02.240 --> 36:03.240
Where is Wen Xiao?

36:05.330 --> 36:08.060
She's on the swing
with Zhao Yuanzhou over there.

36:16.350 --> 36:18.030
What do you want to say?

36:21.270 --> 36:22.390
You would never

36:22.910 --> 36:24.470
let Wen Xiao

36:24.470 --> 36:26.110
be alone with him before.

36:33.780 --> 36:34.930
Mr. Zhuo,

36:35.830 --> 36:37.430
You're innocent and kind.

36:37.810 --> 36:38.790
Don't easily

36:38.790 --> 36:40.590
let down your guard against him.

36:48.450 --> 36:50.320
I'll never let my guard down.

37:10.440 --> 37:12.480
Is everything ready?

37:12.630 --> 37:14.430
The file

37:14.450 --> 37:16.880
has been delivered to Pei Sijing.

37:19.150 --> 37:20.520
Thanks to you,

37:20.930 --> 37:22.210
the fish took the bait.

37:23.940 --> 37:26.700
Pei Sijing saw his face.

37:27.750 --> 37:29.810
She will definitely investigate it.

37:32.240 --> 37:34.670
It’s time to let them know

37:35.750 --> 37:37.630
where the Baize Token is.

37:38.860 --> 37:40.480
Aren’t you afraid that old demon

37:40.480 --> 37:41.670
might kill them?

37:41.920 --> 37:44.440
That old demon is indeed powerful.

37:45.390 --> 37:46.820
I'm scared of him too.

37:47.910 --> 37:50.870
But I want Zhao Yuanzhou and his crew

37:51.370 --> 37:52.670
to suffer.

37:55.770 --> 37:58.370
Can Zhao Yuanzhou really find the Baize Token?

38:30.880 --> 38:32.250
According to the file,

38:32.590 --> 38:34.020
since two days ago,

38:34.280 --> 38:37.510
two households in Tiandu
have been murdered consecutively,

38:37.510 --> 38:39.120
both happening at noon.

38:39.680 --> 38:41.370
No signs of a struggle inside.

38:41.870 --> 38:43.790
It's not a robbery.

39:01.830 --> 39:03.760
Actually, there is another reason

39:05.370 --> 39:07.230
why I'm investigating this case.

39:07.330 --> 39:08.130
What is it?

39:21.710 --> 39:24.770
This is the household
where the first murder occurred.

39:26.040 --> 39:27.570
There's no demonic energy.

39:29.110 --> 39:30.390
My sword is not shining.

39:30.390 --> 39:31.590
I don't need you to tell me.

39:31.590 --> 39:32.830
Yeah...

39:32.830 --> 39:34.390
Awesome...

39:38.500 --> 39:39.800
No blood,

39:41.360 --> 39:43.190
nor signs of fighting.

39:44.540 --> 39:46.090
It looks pretty normal.

39:46.700 --> 39:48.300
It's just that no one is here.

39:49.470 --> 39:50.620
Being too normal

39:51.230 --> 39:52.560
is actually an anomaly.

39:53.710 --> 39:55.510
Your Bingyi Clan's sense of humor

39:55.510 --> 39:56.990
is hard to understand.

40:01.870 --> 40:03.120
Give me your hand.

40:07.570 --> 40:08.840
Is it necessary?

40:11.800 --> 40:13.100
You're so scared.

40:18.090 --> 40:19.680
Are you serious?

40:21.440 --> 40:23.640
Let me borrow some demon blood of yours.

40:23.750 --> 40:25.130
Last time at the Mirror Lake,

40:25.130 --> 40:25.900
I found

40:25.920 --> 40:28.120
your blood on the Yunguang Sword

40:28.710 --> 40:29.840
made its power soar.

40:37.950 --> 40:41.020
Is this the so-called “bloody bad luck”?

40:48.690 --> 40:51.610
♫Can't tell tears from wine♫

40:51.670 --> 40:53.850
♫So frustrating♫

40:54.340 --> 40:59.610
♫The moon and the puppy go with me silently♫

41:00.400 --> 41:03.330
♫Time never stops♫

41:01.100 --> 41:01.710
Ouch...

41:01.710 --> 41:02.910
It hurts...

41:03.400 --> 41:05.270
♫The boy never looks back♫

41:05.610 --> 41:11.050
♫He left his hometown and love behind♫

41:05.870 --> 41:07.430
Why are we in the same squad?

41:08.040 --> 41:09.210
Bloody bad luck...

41:11.350 --> 41:12.590
What are you afraid of?

41:12.590 --> 41:13.400
I'm here.

41:13.430 --> 41:14.140
Let's go.

41:15.470 --> 41:17.600
Is this their strategic arrangement?

41:17.800 --> 41:18.960
In their eyes,

41:18.990 --> 41:20.250
we're...

41:20.990 --> 41:22.450
-Discarded pawns. -Aces.

41:25.790 --> 41:27.340
Aren't you half-god, half-demon?

41:27.340 --> 41:29.270
Are you actually half-pig-demon?

41:29.890 --> 41:30.820
What do you mean?

41:31.090 --> 41:32.950
I'm saying you're as dumb as a pig.

41:36.950 --> 41:37.670
Jiu,

41:37.800 --> 41:38.230
you...

41:38.670 --> 41:41.000
You're getting better at mocking others.

42:00.260 --> 42:02.340
No plum trees in the yard.

42:04.030 --> 42:05.990
Where did these petals come from?

42:08.950 --> 42:10.670
The plates are still warm.

42:13.820 --> 42:15.080
That means...

42:44.560 --> 42:46.090
The murderer is still here.

43:42.900 --> 43:43.700
Sister.
